um/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/963801-possible-host-concepts?p=975505#post975505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's actually pretty interesting, though human sized beehives seem pretty conspicuous xD How does the hives keep themselves from being discovered before the bee-hybrid is done developing?</div> </div> </div> </div>You'd be surprised how easy something man-sized can hide; just look where beehives form in nature! Hollow trees, under awnings, disused ductwork...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T21:36:09-07:00","id":981263,"title":"","content":"I am working on a type of Razilu that used to be a fever or poison, and then evolve into full snakes upon their hosts death. Similar to the Azlu lifestyle. In the modern era, one of the Razilu has teamed up with a Mage. Together they have incorporated the spiritual energies of the poison into an E like drug that consumes souls, and causes the Razilu to evolve into stronger, faster versions then they usually do. Those effected by the drug, called Naga, have a pleasurable high, a relaxation of inhibitions and a quick descent into madness as they become souless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Running: <a href=\"https://shield-bearers.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Shield Bearers - W:TF 2nd</a><br /> Currently Planning: The Dead End Kids - CoD<br /> Untilted Tenra Bansho Zero game<br /> Currently Playing: <a href=\"http://theunusualsuspects.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Unusual Suspects - D:td</a>, I am playing <a href=\"http://www.noordinaryobsession.com/2016/08/19/unusual-suspects-naturalist/\" target=\"_blank\">The Naturalist</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2293-salientmind","name":"salientmind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T16:13:45-07:00","id":982987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>salientmind</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/963801-possible-host-concepts?p=981263#post981263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am working on a type of Razilu that used to be a fever or poison, and then evolve into full snakes upon their hosts death. Similar to the Azlu lifestyle. In the modern era, one of the Razilu has teamed up with a Mage. Together they have incorporated the spiritual energies of the poison into an E like drug that consumes souls, and causes the Razilu to evolve into stronger, faster versions then they usually do. Those effected by the drug, called Naga, have a pleasurable high, a relaxation of inhibitions and a quick descent into madness as they become souless.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really like this idea, its really cool!!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","da